228..305 Comment "/// A handle sent to a writer, which sends it back: the parent closes what it"
306..384 Comment "/// received, never the name it sent. Its two closes sit side by side, and the"
385..460 Comment "/// writer\'s channel plays each move in turn, its close beside the parent\'s"
461..474 Comment "/// last two."
